Description: Visual Studio style C++ solutions in a portable VS Code
 Opens, builds, runs and packages Visual Studio C++ solutions (.slnx, .sln,
 .vcxproj) on Linux without converting them. The editor is downloaded for each
 user on first run and kept separate from any normal VS Code install.
